  TipText:
  - Bosses Are Very Different Than Normal Enemies as they possess more strength and
    have a different attack set
  - "Don\u2019t just punch! Press [R] to counter Boss attacks and deal more damage.
    Timing is Important tho"
  - If The Boss Gets Too Close Too Fast, Press [SHIFT] To Dash Away
  - Finally, When Any Enemy Is Turning Red It Means They Are Trying To Stun You.
    Get Off The Ground To Avoid Waiting For Your Dash
